  "Notes": [
    {
      "Text": "poco security update",
      "Title": "Synopsis",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for poco is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1",
      "Title": "Summary",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This is ROS melodic ros_comm\u0026apos;s 3rdparty poco.\n\nSecurity Fix(es):\n\nUTF32Encoding.cpp in POCO has a Poco::UTF32Encoding integer overflow and resultant stack buffer overflow because Poco::UTF32Encoding::convert() and Poco::UTF32::queryConvert() may return a negative integer if a UTF-32 byte sequence evaluates to a value of 0x80000000 or higher. This is fixed in 1.11.8p2, 1.12.5p2, and 1.13.0.(CVE-2023-52389)",
      "Title": "Description",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "An update for poco is now available for openEuler-24.03-LTS-SP1.\n\nopenEuler Security has rated this update as having a security impact of critical. A Common Vunlnerability Scoring System(CVSS)base score,which gives a detailed severity rating, is available for each vulnerability from the CVElink(s) in the References section.",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "Critical",
      "Title": "Severity",
      "Type": "General"
    },
    {
      "Text": "poco",
      "Title": "Affected Component",
      "Type": "General"
    }
  ],
